5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's behavior carefully.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,I'm excited! This is going to be so much fun. I wonder who the big bad wolf is?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,Me too! I want to find the werewolf! It'll be like a real treasure hunt!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep a cool head. We need to identify the werewolf through logical deduction and consistency.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Logical deduction, huh? I'll be watching everyone. Let's see who slips up first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, you seem very enthusiastic. Is that just your personality, or are you trying to steer the mood?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Asuka, you're so serious! I'm just enjoying the game. Why be so suspicious already?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Maybe May is just happy! I'm happy too! Let's all be friends until we have to vote!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Rin, while cheerfulness is good, we shouldn't let it cloud our judgment. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your innocence is almost too convenient. But for now, I'll just observe.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
