31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have information. May is the werewolf. We should execute her immediately to win.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka, that's a lie! I'm a human! You're the werewolf trying to frame me!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Eh?! May-san is the wolf? That's a big surprise! But Asuka-san seems so sure!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Asuka is claiming to be the Seer. If she is telling the truth, the game ends today.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim right at the start. @Asuka, are you really the Seer, or is this a gamble?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I am the Seer. I divined May last night, and the result was werewolf. There is no reason to gamble.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,May,,"She's lying! I'm just a villager! Please, don't believe her! @Minako, you're the leader, right? Help me!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't know who to believe... but Asuka-san looks very serious. May-san, are you really human?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, your reaction is emotional. @Asuka, your claim is direct. In this situation, the Seer's lead is the most efficient path.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"If Asuka is the werewolf, she's taking a huge risk. If she's the Seer, we win. The logic favors voting May.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. The risk for a werewolf to claim Seer on Day 1 and target someone is high, but the reward for the village is absolute.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,This is unfair! You're all just following her! I'm innocent!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm sorry, May-san! But I think we should trust Asuka-san's magic eyes!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. Unless there is a compelling reason to doubt Asuka, we should follow the divination.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'm convinced. May, your desperation isn't very convincing. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
